  "headline": "Prabowo Seeks 70% Mining Revenue Share As He Hails New Chief Suyudi",
  "seoTitle": "Prabowo Seeks 70% Mining Revenue and Praises Chief Suyudi",
  "metaDescription": "President Prabowo Subianto targets a 70% share of national mining revenue for public projects while affirming his appointment of Police Chief Suyudi.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "President Prabowo Subianto plans to secure 70% of mining revenues for national use to fund infrastructure like schools and water facilities.",
    "The administration is currently developing regulatory schemes to implement this revenue redistribution, receiving support from the Wantimpres.",
    "President Prabowo has publicly commended the newly appointed police chief, Suyudi, following the recent leadership transition."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian government is actively working on a policy proposal to capture 70 percent of mining revenue for the state, intended to support public services such as education and clean water access. Cabinet officials and the Presidential Advisory Council, including Hatta Rajasa, have expressed support for this initiative, which is currently undergoing review to determine the specific implementation mechanisms. Simultaneously, the political landscape has been influenced by the recent appointment of Suyudi as the new National Police Chief. President Prabowo Subianto has publicly voiced his confidence in Suyudi, noting that he did not have a prior personal relationship with the officer before selecting him for the role. These dual developments, concerning both national resource management and key security leadership, continue to draw significant attention from domestic media and various stakeholders across the country.",
